Vendored sources
----------------
The following files are copies of upstream sources, kept unchanged apart from
import specifiers so they can be re-synced by copying the files again:

  src/protocol/index.ts        <- packages/protocol/src/index.ts
  src/protocol/loopback.ts     <- packages/protocol/src/loopback.ts
  tests/support/crypto/index.ts  <- packages/crypto/src/index.ts
  tests/support/crypto/noise.ts  <- packages/crypto/src/noise.ts
  tests/support/test-scenarios.mjs <- scripts/test-scenarios.mjs

web/ is a copy of apps/server/web, including web/UPSTREAM.md which records the
provenance of the UI sources.

Behavioural changes relative to upstream apps/server are documented in
README.md ("What differs from upstream").
